+| layer | owner | presence |
+|---|---|---|
+| `proposer` | B1 | implemented |
+| `block-signature` | B1 | implemented |
+| `qc` | B2 | implemented |
+| `finality` | B3 | placeholder |
+| `validator-set` | B4 | placeholder |
+| `vrf-leader` | B5 | placeholder |
